Package: com.ratush.appabetical
Name: Appabetical
Version: 1.0.16+rootless3
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Alphabetically sort Home Screen icons and folder contents. Latin A-Z, then Cyrillic A-ya, then others; offloaded apps can be moved to the end. Layout presets can also snapshot and restore the Control Center layout (toggle order and enabled state). RootHide port of Avangelista/Appabetical.
Maintainer: chelaxian
Author: Avangelista & sourcelocation (Appabetical, GPLv3) - RootHide port by chelaxian
Section: Tweaks
Depends: ellekit, preferenceloader (>= 2.2)
